<crash-analysis>
The crash is caused by memory leaks in the `clib_package_install_executable` function in `clib/src/common/clib-package.c`.

Specifically, the following variables are allocated but not freed:
- `unpack_dir` at line 1211.
- `deps` at line 1216.
- `flags` at line 1244 or 1246.

To fix this, `free()` should be called on these variables in the `cleanup` section of the function.

```c
// in clib_package_install_executable

cleanup:
free(tmp);
free(command);
free(tarball);
free(file);
free(url);
free(unpack_dir); // Add this
free(deps);       // Add this
// The 'flags' variable from the 'if (pkg->flags)' block also needs to be freed.
// A pointer should be declared outside the block to be accessible here.
return rc;
```
</crash-analysis>

